{
  "id": "move:trillion-app-screens-to-apps",
  "about": "The app-screen rows of trillion-workshop docs/worker-retirement-port-backlog.json that had no home on any main and are not carried by trillion-apps PR #11, moved byte for byte from the tag old-trillion-before-worker-retire into trillion-apps web/ under their source paths (the two native app build scripts to scripts/). records/workshop-screen-tool-records.json is read as rows: trillion-apps main already holds it at web/records/ (changed there since, PR #8), and the moved files read that copy at the same relative path.",
  "source": {
    "name": "Trillion-X/trillion",
    "commit": "b6ae0ebf815f2f5271eed34e6e023c7e1767ec04",
    "test_folders": [
      "test"
    ]
  },
